Version 1.2.4 (2026/07/15)
* Improved efficiency
* Removed the internal table from the global namespace

Version 1.2.3 (2024/07/09)
* ArchivedGetAchievementTimestamp now returns an int53 instead of an id64, to
  match the corresponding change in the base-game GetAchievementTimestamp; any
  addons that use this function must also be updated

Version 1.2.2 (2024/06/01)
* Updated versioning scheme

Version 1.2.1 (2022/03/14)
* LibAchievementsArchive will now fail more gracefully and not generate a Lua
  error if an addon tries to use it before it has fully loaded

Version 1.2.0 (2022/03/13)
* For addon developers: GetValidCharacterIds can now be called with an
  optional onlyCurrentServerAndAccount parameter

Version 1.1.0 (2022/03/11)
* For addon developers: GetCharacterInformation will now assume the current
  character's ID if none is supplied

Version 1.0.0 (2022/03/10)
* Initial version
